; Test a picture pixel
;
; Reads the pixel at the pen position and tells whether it is lit.
;
; Hardware: reads the screen bitmap.
;
; D Pen x, 0-255
; E Pen y, 0-127 (0 is the bottom row of the picture area)
; O:F Z if the pixel is clear, NZ if it is lit
; O:A Pixel mask ANDed with the screen byte
; HL is preserved
@label=TestPixel
c$80EE PUSH HL       ;
 $80EF CALL $81DE    ;
 $80F2 AND (HL)      ;
 $80F3 POP HL        ;
 $80F4 RET           ;
